WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.958 line:80% align:center size:90%
A carne encontra o calor.

00:00:09.958 --> 00:00:14.917 line:80% align:center size:90%
A crosta aparece.

00:00:14.917 --> 00:00:23.917 line:80% align:center size:90%
As ervas entram em cena.

00:00:23.917 --> 00:00:37.708 line:80% align:center size:90%
O queijo muda de textura.

00:00:37.708 --> 00:00:58.708 line:80% align:center size:90%
Dourar, virar, ficar crocante.

00:00:58.708 --> 00:01:06.708 line:80% align:center size:90%
O pão também vai à chapa.

00:01:06.708 --> 00:01:21.708 line:80% align:center size:90%
Os ingredientes, pelas mãos.

00:01:21.708 --> 00:01:29.000 line:80% align:center size:90%
A última etapa dá fome.

